check 1
# World draw list while the camera moves (PC 1 2026-10-10, local-pc1-today): Rogue Encampment,
# the player running west (key R, then the left button held at (180, 300) from frame 42), the list of tick 60, mid-run.
# ScnAma, -seed 1234. Under the debugger 1.14d does not draw every tick: the run compares
# its last drawn tick <= 60 on both sides.
# Spec: specs/tools/scenario-diff.md §3 rule 7; specs/render/camera.md §2-§4.
name draws-run-ama
save ScnAma --class ama --expansion
seed 1234
ticks 64
seconds 600
channels draws
draws-at 60
input frame 38; move 790 10; frame 40; key R; frame 42; hold 180 300 30
